      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "forward pass + backward pass takes 100ms\nbut gradient synchronisation takes 80ms\nThen\n100ms compute\n80ms communication",
